# Compose settings for the day 65 n8n + Ollama (fallback) containers. No API key here:
# the OpenAI key goes in Last3Mon/.env, and register-credentials.sh puts it into n8n.
# Copy to .env and keep the line that matches how Ollama was installed on day 64.
# Ollama installed with the install script (runs as a service):
OLLAMA_DATA=/usr/share/ollama/.ollama
# Ollama started by hand with `ollama serve`:
# OLLAMA_DATA=/home/<your-wsl-user>/.ollama
